<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#Sx5.SSx5.SSSx1" title="In Discussion ‣ Decoding Emotion in the Deep: A Systematic Study of How LLMs Represent, Retain, and Express Emotion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Implications for Alignment and Safety</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#Sx5.SSx5.SSSx2" title="In Discussion ‣ Decoding Emotion in the Deep: A Systematic Study of How LLMs Represent, Retain, and Express Emotion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limitations and Future Work</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
