<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Decoding Emotion in the Deep: A Systematic Study of How LLMs Represent, Retain, and Express Emotion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
